{"meta":{"id":"request-mapping","category":"it/syntax/spring/controller","title":"@Controller · @RequestMapping · Spring","subtitle":"(SPRING)","summary":"클래스 + 메서드 경로, 주소 여러 개, GET/POST 구분, Model 로 값 보내기","tags":["spring","f-network","f-navigation"],"color":"emerald","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-emerald","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-emerald-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>SPRING</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">@Controller · @RequestMapping · Spring</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 클래스 + 메서드 경로, 주소 여러 개, GET/POST 구분, Model 로 값 보내기</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">@Controller · @RequestMapping</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">@Controller\r\n@RequestMapping(&quot;/atom&quot;)                       // 클래스 위: 중간 경로\r\npublic class AtomController {\r\n\r\n    @RequestMapping(value = {&quot;/a1&quot;, &quot;/atom1&quot;}, method = RequestMethod.GET)   // 주소 여러 개\r\n    public String a1Get(Model model, String name) {      // 같은 이름의 파라미터는 자동으로 받음\r\n        model.addAttribute(&quot;data&quot;, &quot;a1에서 갑니다.&quot;);    // 화면으로 보낼 값 (Out)\r\n        return &quot;atom/a1&quot;;                                // prefix + atom/a1 + suffix\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    @RequestMapping(value = &quot;/a1&quot;, method = RequestMethod.POST)   // 같은 주소라도 방식이 다르면 별도 처리\r\n    public String a1Post(HttpServletRequest request) {\r\n        request.setAttribute(&quot;키값&quot;, &quot;값&quot;);\r\n        return &quot;atom/a1&quot;;\r\n    }\r\n}</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">정리</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-emerald-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">요청 주소 = 클래스 @RequestMapping + 메서드 @RequestMapping (예: /atom/a1)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-emerald-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>@GetMapping</code> · <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>@PostMapping</code> 은 method 를 줄여 쓴 형태 (Spring 4.3+)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-emerald-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">화면에서는 ${data} (EL) 로 꺼낸다 — Model 값은 request 범위</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> JSP › EL 데이터 받기, Java › 서블릿</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/spring/controller/request-mapping","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"spring","title":"SPRING","path":"it/syntax/spring"},{"id":"controller","title":"컨트롤러 · 데이터 통신","path":"it/syntax/spring/controller"}],"hasImage":false}